  "visible_text": "若圓 $x^2 + y^2 - 8x + ky - 214 = 0$ 的一直徑通過點 $(6, -5)$ 且該直徑的斜率為 $-4$，則 $k =$ (A) $-6$ (B) $-4$ (C) $13$ (D) $70$",
  "answer": "A",
  "reasoning": "Find the center of the circle as $(4, -k/2)$. The diameter line through $(6,-5)$ with slope $-4$ is $4x + y - 19 = 0$. Substituting the center into this line gives $4(4) + (-k/2) - 19 = 0$, which simplifies to $-k/2 = 3$, so $k = -6$, corresponding to option A."
